  "description": "Proof-of-work (hashcash) admission gate for SetNet: on connect the server issues a challenge and drops a peer's frames until it submits a nonce whose SHA-256 has enough leading zero bits — making mass/bot connections CPU-costly. server.UseProofOfWork(difficulty); client.UseProofOfWork(). Depends only on SetNet.",
